[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Fencing Vision - Sharing and Privacy Requirements
UID: FV-SHARING-PRIVACY

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @fencing-vision-requirement

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-001
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Private by default
STATEMENT: Every clip, analysis, source video, and derived artifact shall be private by default.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-002
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Server-side authorization
STATEMENT: The system shall verify ownership or an explicit sharing permission on the server for every clip, analysis, artifact, export, and share-link operation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-003
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Private storage paths
STATEMENT: Possession of an internal storage path shall not grant access to stored video or generated artifacts.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-004
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Authorised media delivery
STATEMENT: The system shall require an authorised request or a short-lived signed URL to download private video or artifacts.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-005
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Sensitive log data
STATEMENT: Logs and user-facing errors shall not expose private media URLs, share tokens, magic links, or credentials.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-006
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Complete deletion
STATEMENT: Deleting a clip shall delete or schedule deletion of its source media, derived assets, analyses, exports, and active share links.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PRIVACY-007
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Review
TITLE: External tester policy
STATEMENT: A retention and account-deletion policy shall be defined before external testers are given access to the system.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-001
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-SHARING
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Scoped share link
STATEMENT: A clip owner shall be able to create a share link scoped to one clip and one selected analysis.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-002
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-SHARING
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Authenticated share access
STATEMENT: The system shall require a share-link recipient to authenticate before revealing clip metadata, media, or analysis results.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-003
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-SHARING
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Read-only shared view
STATEMENT: A valid share link shall grant its authenticated recipient read-only access to the scoped clip and selected analysis.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-004
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-SHARING
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Library isolation
STATEMENT: A share-link recipient shall not gain access to the clip owner's account, library, other clips, or unselected analyses.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-005
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-SHARING
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Optional share expiry
STATEMENT: The clip owner shall be able to assign an optional expiry time to a share link.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-006
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-SHARING
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Immediate revocation
STATEMENT: The clip owner shall be able to revoke a share link so it no longer grants access on subsequent requests.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-007
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Unguessable share tokens
STATEMENT: The system shall generate share tokens with sufficient entropy to resist practical guessing.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-SHARE-008
STATUS: Draft
SOURCE: CAP-TRUST
VERIFICATION: Automated test
TITLE: Secure token storage
STATEMENT: The system shall store share-token verification material so disclosure of the stored value does not directly disclose an active share token.
